  "description": "Ships a service's daily Serilog rolling log file to a Telegram chat once a day, plus an on-demand \"send the log now\" API. Talks to the Bot API directly over HttpClient - no ASP.NET Core FrameworkReference, no Telegram.Bot package, safe for a plain console worker. Targets net8.0 through net10.0.",
