  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.1.0: Initial release. Daily Telegram delivery of a Serilog RollingInterval.Day log file via a BackgroundService, plus an on-demand ITelegramLogSender (SendLatestAsync / SendPreviousDayAsync / SendDailyLogAsync) for a manual \"send the log now\" command. Extracted from DiscordBotMike's TelegramLogService and its Chronos and HyperionOmniClient ports.\n\nFull changelog: https://github.com/TechTeaStudio/NotificationMachine/blob/product/CHANGELOG.md",
